{"product_id":"the-remnant","title":"The Remnant","description":"\u003cp\u003eAbout the Author      Christy Kenneally is a well-known Irish TV presenter and scriptwriter. Christy presented RTE's 'No Frontiers' series and has been published on numerous occasions. Maura's Boy, The New Curate and Life After Loss have all featured on Ireland's Bestseller list. Christy is married and lives in Dublin. His first novel Second Son went to No 3 in the Irish Bestseller chart.      Product Description      The Pope is dying. In the catacombs of San Domatilla, far beneath the streets of Rome, a militant group of disaffected priests is urged to wage a new inquisition. As Father Michael Flaherty accepts a new appointment to the Vatican department run by African-American cardinal J. Arthur Thomas, he enters a state within a state, where priests vie for influence and power. A former U.S. Marine, Flaherty finds himself in a different kind of war—made all the more deadly because both sides wear the same uniform. In the shadow of the Pope's final days, Michael Flaherty steps into the crosshairs of those who ruthlessly pursue the ultimate prize—the Church itself. They are the Remnant.      Review      \"Agreeable thrills and a few pleasant peeks into Italian domestic life.\"  —Kirkus Reviews\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 152 x 229\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Christy Kenneally\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780340897683\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 312\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45387139317913,"sku":"15RC-4-9780340897683","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6822db71b511c_The_Remnant_Christy_Kenneally.jpg?v=1747151868","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-remnant","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}